<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id">- Vidunda Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Nahumu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nahumu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nahumu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nah</para>
  <para style="mt">Nahumu</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu achi china uloli wa Nahumu. Usenga wa Nahumu nawali kuwala isi ya Ashulu. Kanguichema isi ayi Ninawi, kwa vila ndo itagwa lya muji ukulu wa isi ayo. Isi ya Ashulu nayali undewa uwele nauwasumya na kuwahola wanhu wa honhu ha kasikazini ha undewa wa Isilaeli na kuwahilika kuli isi ya chijenzi. Nahumu nakalonga kuwala kugwa kwa muji ulinguchemigwa Tebesi (3:8), toweza kuvizela kota nakalavya uloli kuli mhela wa hagati ha mwaka miya sita na makumi sita na tatu (663), Yesu yang'hali kupondigwa, mhela uwele muji wa Tebesi naugwa na mwaka miya sita na kumi na mbili (612), Yesu yang'hali kupondigwa, mhela uwele muji wa Ninawi naugwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga wa Nahumu nawali ulonga kota Nguluwi kowagaza wawele na nongwa. Hanga Nguluwi halinguzudila himahima, ila kana mong'ho (1:3). Nakalonga kota Ashulu yahagwile na wanhu wake wahaholigwe na kuhilikwa kuli isi ya chijenzi. Kwa wanhu wa Yuda, mbuli ayi nayali inojile lukami kwa hewo (1:15).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1:1-8 yangulonga kota Nguluwi kana hachi na yalinguhilula chibida.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 1:9 mbaka kuli sula ya 3, zangulonga kuwala utaguso ulinguwala isi ya Ashulu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NAM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 1:1"/>Ulonzi wa Nguluwi kuwala muji wa Ninawi kuli isi ya Ashulu. Chitabu cha kulola kwa Nahumu wa Elikoshi.<verse eid="NAM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzudila kwa Nguluwi hali Ninawi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 1:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo Nguluwi yawele na fihi, yalinguhilula chibida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:2">Mkulu Nguluwi kanguhilula chibida na kana ng'halazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:2">Mkulu Nguluwi kanguhilula chibida kwa wang'honyo wa heye, kangulutilila kuwazudila wang'honyo wa heye.<verse eid="NAM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 1:3"/>Mkulu Nguluwi hambe yazudile hima, ila nakamema mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:3">Mkulu Nguluwi mazuwa gose hambe yaleche kuwagaza wawele na nongwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:3">Nzila yalingukola Mkulu Nguluwi, changulawilaga chivuluvumbi chikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:3">ng'hungugu ndo chivuluvumbi chilingwenezwa na nzayo za heye.<verse eid="NAM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 1:4"/>Kanguing'hanuchilaga bahali na kuikaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:4">heye kangwambuza nzanda zeng'ha zikale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:4">Viwala viwele Bashani na chidunda cha Kalimeli vyanguswina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:4">uluwa wa Lebanoni wanguswina.<verse eid="NAM 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 1:5"/>Vidunda vyangukakama hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:5">navyo vidunda vyangusungulumuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:5">isi na vyeng'ha viwele amo vyangukakama hali heye.<verse eid="NAM 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 1:6"/>Whaani yalinguweza kuwa habehi na kuzudila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:6">Whaani yalinguweza kwimilila kung'hang'hala kwa ng'halazi ya heye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:6">Heye kangubohola ng'halazi ya heye ilingwaka kota chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:6">na mitalawe jangutulika vihandevihande hoyojihejelela.<verse eid="NAM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 1:7"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kagoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:7">heye ka ngome ya kikala goya mhela wa magazo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:7">Heye kanguwamilaga weng'ha walingubilimila kikala goya kwa heye.<verse eid="NAM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 1:8"/>Ila kwa mazi menji ng'hatu koidumya Ninawi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:8">kanguwosaga na kuwawinga mbaka kuli jiza.<verse eid="NAM 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 1:9"/>Lekachoni mwangijesa kudita chinhu chihile hali Mkulu Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:9">Heye kogadumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:9">na yalingitwanza na heye howeza kwima kahi.<verse eid="NAM 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 1:10"/>Wodumigwa kota chisosolo cha miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:10">na kugala kwa ujimbi wa hewo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:10">wolakazwa kota vila mibeleje jikalile.<verse eid="NAM 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 1:11"/>Kulawa hegwe Ninawi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:11">nakalawa munhu yalingugana kudita wihe hali Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:11">yalingunuwila kudita vinhu vya udesi.<verse eid="NAM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 1:12"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalonjela hino wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:12">“Hanga wanhu wa Ninawi ndo wenji na wawele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:12">woduliswa na kudumigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:12">Hanga nandiwagaza hemwe wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:12">siwagaza kahi.<verse eid="NAM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 1:13"/>Lelo ndoibena ngwamo ya Ashulu kuli singo za hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:13">na minyololo jowowahindile ndojidumulanga”<verse eid="NAM 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 1:14"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga hino kuwala Ninawi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">“Huweza kuwa na walelwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">Jimalukolo ja hegwe ja kuhongola na ja kuponda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">ndojibena kuli haluga ha milungu ja hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">Ndokubawila chilaga cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">kwa vila hegwe haulingukundigwa.”<verse eid="NAM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NAM 1:15"/>Hemwe wanhu wa Yuda mlole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:15">kanguya kulawa kuli chidunda, munhu yalingigala mbuli zinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:15">msenga yalinguwikula kikala goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:15">Mdite mvina za hemwe, hemwe wanhu wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:15">mweneze kilaha kwa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:15">kwa vila wehile hawowavaba kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:15">kwa vila wodumigwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="NAM 1:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NAM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kugwa kwa Ninawi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 2:1"/>Wamizi wa Ninawi wangulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">“Yalingudumya kanguya kututowa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">Twamile ngome za hetwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">Tuwiche wamizi mbalabala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">Tiwiche goya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">Tukungajize mong'ho wa hetwe weng'ha.”<verse eid="NAM 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 2:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi komhilusila Yakobo ludali lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:2">ena, kowapa kahi Waisilaeli ludali lwa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:2">hanga walinguvaba hawawalechele chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:2">mbaka nhagala za hewo za mizabibu nawazitema.<verse eid="NAM 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 2:3"/>Ngawo za wamizi wa heye ndo ndung'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:3">wazidahe kitowa ngondo wa heye nawavala mivalo midung'hu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:3">Mituka ja hewo ja falasi jangupulika kota lumuli lwa chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:3">kuli zuwa lyoyajiwichile goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:3">migoha ja mibeloshi ja hewo jangupulika.<verse eid="NAM 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 2:4"/>Mituka ja falasi jangubilima kuli nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:4">jangubilima aku na kula hagati ha muji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:4">Jangoneka kota milapi ja chiluli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:4">Jangubilima kota lumwemwesa.<verse eid="NAM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 2:5"/>Lelo mkulu kanguwachema vilongozi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:5">nawo wangikwang'wala vyowalinguluta kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:5">wangubilimila kuli lukanzi lwa miji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:5">leka kuwika goya ngawo ya hewo.<verse eid="NAM 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 2:6"/>Lwizi ja lwanda najidoholigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:6">ng'handa ya mndewa naigwa.<verse eid="NAM 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 2:7"/>Muji wa mwanzi lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:7">wanhu wanguholigwa na kuhilikwa kuli isi ya chijenzi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:7">Wapogozi wake wadala wangulombocheza kota ng'hunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:7">na kitowa kuli mhambaga za hewo kwa masinzo.<verse eid="NAM 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 2:8"/>Ninawi ndo kota ilamba libomoche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:8">wanhu wake wanguubilima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:8">Lizi lyanguchemeleza, “Mwime! Mwime!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:8">Ila haduhu yalingulola kumbele.<verse eid="NAM 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 2:9"/>Walinguivaba Ninawi wangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:9">“Mhole vinhu vya sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:9">mhole vinhu vya zahabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:9">Ng'hano yake yahela kuduma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:9">Hana winji wa chila chinhu cha sendi nyinji.”<verse eid="NAM 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 2:10"/>Muji wa Ninawi nauholigwa na kuwifigwa na kulechigwa uchiwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:10">Wanhu wake nawatweguka nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:10">mafugamilo gawo gangukakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:10">mong'ho wa hewo naumala, kumeho kwa hewo nakugaluka kwa chiwalo cha lunhwinhwi.<verse eid="NAM 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 2:11"/>Wa kohi muji wula uwele kota mhalika ya misimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:11">hawele ndo honhu hawo ha kivisa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:11">Ha ndaze aho honhu ha misimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:11">hawele haduhu yawezile kujitinhusa?<verse eid="NAM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 2:12"/>Isimba ilume nalidadula miwunde ja kuhega kwa chiwalo cha myana jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:12">naliwabatila misimba midala upelembi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:12">mhalika yake naimema upelembi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:12">haluga hake hana vihande vinji vya miwunde.<verse eid="NAM 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 2:13"/>Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho kanguwikula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:13">“Lelo ndangitwanza na hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:13">Mituka ja hemwe ja ngondo ndojidumya kwa chiluli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:13">na kujikopola kwa ipanga myana isimba ja hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:13">Siwalechela upelembi kuli isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:13">Lizi lya wasenga wa hegwe haluhulikwa kahi.”<verse eid="NAM 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NAM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 3:1"/>Kochona gwa Ninawi, muji ulingukopola!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:1">Nakumema uhadi hela na vinhu vinji viholigwe kuli ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:1">hulinguleka kuhola vinhu kulawa kuli ngondo.<verse eid="NAM 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 3:2"/>Uhulichize! Lizi lya ng'hobwa ya ngozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:2">lizi lya kujenda kwa maguludumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:2">lizi lya kujenda kwa falasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:2">na kubuma kwa mituka ja ngondo.<verse eid="NAM 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 3:3"/>Walingukwina falasi wangubilimisa falasi baho du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">wakopoligwe ndo wenji lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">mitufi minji ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">mbaka wanhu wangikwang'hala mchanya mwa mitufi.<verse eid="NAM 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 3:4"/>“Ninawi! Hegwe ndo kota mng'hondwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:4">Nakuwakwega wanhu kwa kinoliga, gwa mhinza wa uhawi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:4">nakuwadita wanhu wa isi zinji wawe wapogozi kwa ung'hondwa wa hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:4">na kwa uhawi wa hegwe.<verse eid="NAM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 3:5"/>Lelo heni Mkulu Nguluwi Mbele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:5">ndangitwanza na hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:5">ndolikwiniza ivalo lya hegwe mbaka kumutwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:5">ndowadita wanhu wa isi wawone umwanzi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:5">chila undewa uyone soni ya hegwe.<verse eid="NAM 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 3:6"/>Ndokutozela wavu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:6">na kukuditila kwa kubeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:6">na kuwadita wanhu wakuseche.<verse eid="NAM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 3:7"/>Hamba weng'ha howokona wokubilima na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:7">‘Ninawi nakudumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:7">whaani yolombocheza kwa chiwalo cha hegwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:7">Whaani yokuhembuliza?’ ”<verse eid="NAM 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 3:8"/>Ndaze, hegwe Ninawi ndo kunoga kusinda Tebesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:8">muji uzenjigwe hafungo ha lwanda Naili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:8">Tebesi nauzungulutwa na mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:8">lwanda nalwali ngawo yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:8">mazi nagali lukanzi lwake.<verse eid="NAM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 3:9"/>Kushi na Misili nazali mong'ho wa heye ulihela mbaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:9">Puti na Libiya nawali hali wala welumbile na heye.<verse eid="NAM 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 3:10"/>Ila nakaholigwa kota mpogozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:10">wanhu wa heye nawahilikwa kuli isi zinji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:10">Mbaka wana wa heye nawabenangwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:10">kuli chila nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:10">wakulu wake nawaguzigwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:10">wang'hangala wake weng'ha nawawohigwa kwa minyololo.<verse eid="NAM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 3:11"/>Ninawi, nagwe kahi kogala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:11">kombilima mng'honyo na kujeza kivisa.<verse eid="NAM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 3:12"/>Ngome za hegwe zeng'ha ndo kota migodi ja tini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:12">jiwele mafuza gake ga mwaluko nagapya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:12">mhela hojitigaswa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:12">tini zangugwilaga kuli mlomo wa yalingulya.<verse eid="NAM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 3:13"/>Lole wamizi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:13">walingudumba kota wadala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:13">Lwizi ja isi ya hegwe ja mwanzi hali wang'honyo wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:13">chiluli nachilakaza ng'hatu lwizi jake.<verse eid="NAM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 3:14"/>Mdehe mazi leka miwiche goya kwa chiwalo cha kuzungulutwa kwa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:14">mziwiche nzinzili ngome za hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:14">Mbiganje ilongo kwa chiwalo cha kulikolela mijito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:14">mliwiche goya itanuli lya kusomela matufali.<verse eid="NAM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NAM 3:15"/>Ila ako kahi chiluli chowalakaza hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:15">ipanga lyowakopola hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:15">wowadumya kota nzije vyozilingulya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NAM 3:15"/>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:15">Monjezeche kota nzije,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:15">ena, monjezeche kota ndede.<verse eid="NAM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NAM 3:16"/>Walinguguza vinhu wa hegwe nawonjezeka kusinda nhondwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:16">ila wanguka kota ndede vyozilinguguluka na kuileka isi ne chinhu.<verse eid="NAM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NAM 3:17"/>Wakulu wa hegwe ndo kota ndede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:17">vilongozi wa hegwe ndo kota chilundo cha nzije,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:17">mhela wa chipute zangikala kuli lukanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:17">ila isanya holilawa, zanguguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:17">haduhu yalinguvizela hozilutile.<verse eid="NAM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NAM 3:18"/>Hegwe mndewa wa Ashulu, wadimi wa hegwe nawawasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:18">vilongozi wa hegwe nawasinzila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:18">Wanhu wa hegwe nawasambaluka kuli vidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:18">haduhu yoneche wa kuwakungajiza.<verse eid="NAM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NAM 3:19"/>Haduhu wa kuhoza kulumila kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:19">vilonda vya hegwe vya kubagama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:19">Weng'ha walinguhulika mbuli za hegwe wangutowa luchenze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:19">Kwa vila haduhu yawezile kiwika kutali na nhumbula ya hegwe yihile ilihela kuduma.<verse eid="NAM 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 3"/>
</usx>
